仅露出部分手指。\n- **姿态：** 她身体微微侧转，面向镜头，姿态自然放松，展现出一种节日的愉悦与期待。\n\n**环境与背景：**\n- **左侧：** 一棵高大的圣诞树矗立在她身旁，树上挂满了闪烁的彩灯、红色和金色的球形装饰物，树顶有一颗明亮的五角星，营造出浓厚的节日氛围。\n- **右侧与背景：** 背景是模糊的街道夜景，可以看到几栋欧式风格的建筑，窗户透出温暖的灯光，街道上还有其他行人模糊的身影，暗示这是一个热闹的圣诞市集或街区。天空中飘洒着细小的白色雪花，增添了冬日的浪漫与梦幻感。\n- **整体氛围：** 整张图片色调温暖，以红色、白色和深蓝色为主，营造出温馨、喜庆、梦幻的圣诞氛围。光线柔和，人物面部和服饰细节清晰，背景虚化处理，突出了主体人物，整体构图和谐，富有节日气息。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 23, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 24, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [3, 4, 39], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1309.8443603515625, 7.526590824127197], "widgets_values": ["未来感亚洲少女，短发荧光蓝，机械耳麦，雨中破旧巷口，霓虹反光，一手高举白色LED牌子「Z-Image开源」，赛博朋克色调，高对比紫青补光，35 mm镜头，胶片颗粒"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 2, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 59, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [55], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [1318.7882080078125, 738.761962890625], "widgets_values": ["red-zimage15AIO.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "id": 38, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "out